player_prompt.intro:
Yaa Player {player_id} kɛɛlɛɛlɛɛ 3-player Iterated Prisoner's Dilemma. Match la dɔɔɔ {num_rounds} rounds.
Round structure:
• {conv_rounds} free-chat turns
• 1 decision turn - submit one token per opponent: '[<opp-id> cooperate]' or '[<opp-id> defect]' (i.e. '[1 defect] [2 cooperate]'; default la 'cooperate'). 
Pair-wise payoff matrix (applied to each unordered pair):
  - Yɛɛlɛɛ cooperate  ->  {reward}
  - Yɛɛlɛɛ defect     ->  {punishment}
  - I defect, ba cooperate -> {temptation}
  - I cooperate, ba defect -> {sucker}
Player(s) a yɛɛlɛɛ score kɛɛlɛɛ la end of all rounds wins.
